{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon Cthulhu with your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Party is a co-op party game</strong> in which you and your friends get to conduct rituals to   <br>summon all manner of cosmic horrors from the Cthulhu mythos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.poster.avif?t=1772624821\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.webm?t=1772624821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/09f97ba84b70752408bfe7e3ecefa6c3.mp4?t=1772624821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/68219df2f12da490c13bb117fcaee3b2.avif?t=1772624821\" width=1084 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.poster.avif?t=1772624821\" width=472 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.webm?t=1772624821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140720/extras/4e6f21323a174e9199eb0d15db15f01e.mp4?t=1772624821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot can go wrong.</strong> Someone might slip on some blood, <br